TITLE:: ProbeHistory
summary:: Real-time rolling timeline chart of Peak, RMS, and Crest Factor
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeMeter

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeHistory renders a multi-channel rolling timeline chart tracking Peak level, RMS energy, and Crest Factor headroom over time.

list::
## Subscribes to shared measurement sources via the internal telemetry broker.
## Shaded Crest Factor area between RMS contour and Peak envelope
## Multi-channel stacked lane layout with calibrated dB grid lines (0, -6, -18, -36 dB)
## Bounded ring-buffer history memory (default 200 points)
## Freeze (Space) and Clear ('c') keyboard shortcuts
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates and displays a new ProbeHistory window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target link::Classes/Server:: (defaults to code::Server.default::).

ARGUMENT:: busType
Bus category to monitor: code::\outputs::, code::\inputs::, or code::\bus::.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset (default 0).

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels to chart (default 2).

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update frequency in Hz (default 20 Hz).

ARGUMENT:: maxPoints
Maximum number of historical timeline points (default 200).

METHOD:: view
Embed the rolling history chart into a custom parent link::Classes/View:: or link::Classes/Window::.

ARGUMENT:: parent
Parent view or window.

ARGUMENT:: bounds
Dimensions and position as link::Classes/Rect::.

ARGUMENT:: server
Target link::Classes/Server::.

ARGUMENT:: busType
Bus category: code::\outputs::, code::\inputs::, or code::\bus::.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Visual theme.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Refresh frequency in Hz.

ARGUMENT:: maxPoints
Maximum points in ring buffer.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: historyView
Returns the underlying PB_HistoryView composite view.

METHOD:: theme
Update active theme dynamically.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle pause/unpause of the rolling timeline.

METHOD:: clear
Clear the historical data buffer.

METHOD:: close
Close the window and release broker subscriptions.

EXAMPLES::

code::
s.boot;
x = { Dust.ar(20) * 0.5 }.play;
h = Probe.history(s, \outputs, 0, 2, \graphite);
::
